435","id":619078844,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxOTA3ODg0NA==","user":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-24T15:25:07Z","updated_at":"2020-04-24T15:25:07Z","body":"This uncovers something else though: because the default output base is under `/private/var/tmp`, and because the sandbox configuration allows blanket write access to `tmp` directories... the sandbox isn't really protecting against writes across different per-action directories! Yikes. I'll add a note to #11100 about this, which I think is where we should tackle this separate issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/619078844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jmmv","id":879272,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3OTI3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/879272?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv","html_url":"https://github.com/jmmv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmmv/follower